{'symbol': 'MAR', 'date': '2023-05-12 13:00:00', 'title': 'MARRIOTT INTERNATIONAL DECLARES AN INCREASE IN QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': "BETHESDA, MD. , MAY 12, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MARRIOTT INTERNATIONAL, INC. (NASDAQ: MAR) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF 52 CENTS PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK, WHICH REPRESENTS A 30 PERCENT INCREASE OVER THE PREVIOUS QUARTERLY DIVIDEND AMOUNT OF 40 CENTS PER SHARE AND REFLECTS THE COMPANY'S EARNINGS GROWTH AND STRONG CASH GENERATION."}